{"4694350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightmare Fishing Tournament", "steam_appid": 4694350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/89002166f6791435190af4a2e517862b.avif?t=1779100244\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't be fooled by the &quot;<i>fishing</i>&quot; part, this tip to the sea is to <strong>DIE </strong>for...<br><br>Arriving after death in the underworld, a rotting corpse participates in a <strong>HELLISH</strong> fishing tournament. The grand prize? <i>A RETURN to the LAND OF THE LIVING!</i> So get out there and <strong>FISH</strong> like your <strong>LIFE</strong> depends on it! But watch out, each swim with the fishes could be your <i>LAST!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/41a4dfae57efcb3a4b1ea06ee44c50f6.avif?t=1779100244\" width=972 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn <strong>CREDITS </strong>from the <strong><i>SHOP REAPER</i></strong> to buy the netgun, the multi-ammo type speargun, floating sea mines and more. Carve the scales from your enemies in brutal knife combat and craft different <strong>PERKS</strong>! Enhance maximum lung capacity, or purchase a diving bell to extend aquatic expeditions and harvest the bounty of the seafloor! Swimming to slow? Boat handles like a shopping cart? The upgrades are all there for you to <i>craft</i> and get an <strong>EDGE</strong> on the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/05d1b4fcc674706e5ed54c463d7d7c47.avif?t=1779100244\" width=1122 height=742 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Best of all, <strong>CAPTURE</strong> and <strong>TAME</strong> the &quot;<i>Peril Porpoise</i>&quot; to  use it to <strong><i>FIGHT FOR YOU! </i></strong>Training a killer mammal from <i>HELL</i> truly changes the game, opening up new ways of approaching undersea combat!<br><br>Bait the hook. Catch the fish. Win the tournament...or die <strong><i>AGAIN</i></strong> trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/eb9c1f904a15c1829310e856ae0a69f2.avif?t=1779100244\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras_big/eb9c1f904a15c1829310e856ae0a69f2.avif?t=1779100244 width=1560 height=756 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/89002166f6791435190af4a2e517862b.avif?t=1779100244\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't be fooled by the &quot;<i>fishing</i>&quot; part, this tip to the sea is to <strong>DIE </strong>for...<br><br>Arriving after death in the underworld, a rotting corpse participates in a <strong>HELLISH</strong> fishing tournament. The grand prize? <i>A RETURN to the LAND OF THE LIVING!</i> So get out there and <strong>FISH</strong> like your <strong>LIFE</strong> depends on it! But watch out, each swim with the fishes could be your <i>LAST!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/41a4dfae57efcb3a4b1ea06ee44c50f6.avif?t=1779100244\" width=972 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn <strong>CREDITS </strong>from the <strong><i>SHOP REAPER</i></strong> to buy the netgun, the multi-ammo type speargun, floating sea mines and more. Carve the scales from your enemies in brutal knife combat and craft different <strong>PERKS</strong>! Enhance maximum lung capacity, or purchase a diving bell to extend aquatic expeditions and harvest the bounty of the seafloor! Swimming to slow? Boat handles like a shopping cart? The upgrades are all there for you to <i>craft</i> and get an <strong>EDGE</strong> on the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694350/extras/05d1b4fcc674706e5ed54c463d7d7c47.avif?t=1779100244\" width=1122 height=742 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Best of all, <strong>CAPTURE</strong> and <strong>TAME</strong> the &quot;<i>Peril Porpoise</i>&quot; to  use it to <strong><i>FIGHT FOR YOU! </i></strong>Training a killer mammal from <i>HELL</i> truly changes the game, opening up new ways of approaching undersea combat!<br><br>Bait the hook. Catch the fish. Win the tournament...or die <strong><i>AGAIN</i></strong> trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c